[...]
>Local -941- Tranceiver loopback error
>Local -942- Image load not attempted
[...]

The problem has been fixed (kludged?) such that the DECserver can boot
now. What I did was to put the DB15 loopback connector on the DECserver
and then power it on. The loopback test was successful at that point. 
I then yanked off the loopback connector and put the old tranceiver
back on the DECserver. It found its boot node and is now happy (I'm
using it to post this message).

Thanks anyway,
Chris
