processes on a variety of OS dialects -- AIX, DYNIX, EP/IX, ETAV,
HP-UX, IRIX, NeXTStep, Solaris, SunOS.  Version 2.28 adds support
for DEC Alpha OSF/1 1.2 and 1.3.

