 writes:
|>I'm trying to put (without any documentation) two 170M Maxtor drives
|>on a Micro Vax II (with a RQDX3 card).
|>
|>The system works with one disk. I just put a second one in it,
|>control the kernel ( the secon disk is declared) and the /dev/ files 
|>all seems to be ok. I tried several positions for the jumpers on the 
|>second HD without success. The second drive didn't want to work.
