What kind of cabinet do you have?  BA23 (the narrow pedestal) or BA123
(the wider cabinet on wheels)?  If it's a BA23, the power supply can't support
two hard drives, and even if it could, you'd have to do some "hacking" of
the RQDX3 and/or the front panel to make it work.

If you have a BA123, the disk has to be formatted for the RQDX3 before it
will work.
