  I believe that the highest memory configuration supported uses 4Mbit
DRAM. The DECstation series machines use the same segment (K0, I think)
for both physical memory and I/O address space. This segment has a 512
limit on it. This is why th maximum memory in the DS5000/200 series was
480MB, we needed 32MB of address space for the TURBOchannel options. If
my memory serves me correctly, the maximum memory configurations are:

		DS5000/xx	 40MB
